<title>GERMANY: Leica 9-mo net profit 4.9 mln dmk vs loss.</title>
<headline>Leica 9-mo net profit 4.9 mln dmk vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SOLMS, Germany 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to December 31, first nine months of 1996/1997 fiscal year</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   4.9     vs 1.6 loss</p>
<p>    Earnings before interest and tax     5.0     vs 2.1</p>
<p>    Net sales				    174.8   vs 163.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German camera maker is Leica Camera AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
